## 8. Verification & Acceptance Criteria

1. **Hierarchy Integrity**: Users can only approve work within their explicit reporting tree; Project Managers can create, but cannot self-approve without Line Manager sign-off.
2. **Global Visibility**: Logging in as Secretary General or Admin displays all 50+ documents and pending approvals across all divisions.
3. **Plug-and-Play AI**: Entering a personal Gemini API key in Settings immediately powers live RAG streaming without restarts or server reconfiguration.
4. **DOCX & PDF Parity**: Both formats are fully parsed, searchable, and cited in generated answers.
5. **Always-On Railway URL**: Instant access with zero sleep timeouts, fast response times, and clean UI aesthetics.
